# Check
check that the absolute of magnitude is 9007199254740993.
check that the result of division is [-2, -3, -1, 2].
check that (-7 quotient 3) times 3 plus (-7 remainder 3) is equal to -7.
check that (-7 floor quotient 3) times 3 plus (-7 modulo 3) is equal to -7.
check that the result of rounding is [-3, -2, -2, -2, -2, -0.5].
check that round of -1.5 is equal to -1.
check that the result of extrema is [1e21, 1000000000000000000001].
check that the result of gcd is 6.
check that the result of bits is [4, 15, 11, -14, 104, 1].
check that 1 shifted left by 100 is equal to 1267650600228229401496703205376.
check that constant pi is greater than 3.
check that constant e is less than 3.
check that the circumference of circle is 18.84955592153876.
check that absolute value of (tangent of arc tangent of 1 minus 1) is at most 0.000000000001.
